                "offset": 0
              },
              "name": "The City of London",
              "subtitle": "Named among the liberties confirmed",
              "body": "Singled out by name among the charter's grants: the city is confirmed in enjoying all its ancient liberties and free customs by land and water, alongside a general promise extending the same to other cities, boroughs, towns, and ports."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "no-free-man",
          "kind": "personification",
          "storyRole": "central",
          "roleVisibleAt": {
